mode: print
Joystick buttons:
  button 4    -> STOP walking and SIT/CROUCH pose
  button 5    -> STAND pose
  buttons 0-3 -> EMERGENCY STOP
  D-pad zero request -> ignored while fixed hardware stand-zero is active
Joystick axes:
  left stick Y  -> forward/back vx
  left stick X  -> left/right vy
  right stick X -> turn/yaw
Terminal keys:
  w/s -> straight vx, a/d -> lateral vy, combine for xy diagonal
  q/e -> positive/negative yaw; combine with translation if needed
  c -> SIT/CROUCH, space -> STAND
  up/down arrows -> increase/decrease speed scale
  h -> HOLD current position, x -> EMERGENCY STOP
